      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Creator companion is a program that lines things up for unity projects, the actual work done is inside the unity editor. \n\nIt would be interesting to see what can be done inside VR, I don't know if horizon worlds still has it but at one point they had tools for world building in VR",
