  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I feel like the VRChat Creator Companion should come to standalone MetaQuest so the people that don't have access to computers but have a MetaQuest should also get a chance to make avatars and worlds without a PC I feel like this could make a lot of VRChat users happy being able to create things with out a required PC. Or maybe that on Quest in the VRChat menu there could be an area that let's you make avatars and worlds only on your VR maybe they could buy premade models and use those for avatars/worlds like a body, head, hair, clothes, map, accessories, and landscape models too.",
